---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/baseLayout.astro";
import WorkItem from "../components/workItem.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="Resume">
  <article>
    <h2>Notes</h2>
    <article>
      <h3>Work permit</h3>
      <p>H-1B authorization, USA</p>
      <p>Citizen, India</p>
    </article>
  </article>
  <article>
    <h2>Work Experience</h2>
    <WorkItem
      title="Senior product designer at AppDynamics (Cisco)"
      from="2021"
    >
      <p>
        Research and design of various product features pertaining to Cisco's
        AppDynamics division.
      </p>
      <p>
        Active projects include improving overall product navigation experience,
        and exposing Trace data via the OpenTelemetry specification.
      </p>
    </WorkItem>
    <WorkItem title="UX Designer at PlanetScale" from="2018" to="2021">
      <p>
        Design and development of various touchpoints encompassing the web
        application, and supporting artifacts (marketing website,
        documentation).
      </p>
      <p>
        Highlights include a simplified dashboard to create and deploy databases
        online. Focus on making multi-cloud, multi-region, and database sharding
        easier to grasp and be consumed by developers.
      </p>
    </WorkItem>
    <article>
      <h3>Freelance</h3>
      <p>
        <time datetime="2016">2016</time> - <time datetime="2018">2018</time>
      </p>
      <p>
        Work on multiple projects on contractual terms spanning industries
        including payment solutions (BillDesk), virtual networking (Juniper
        Networks), journalism (PARI), fintech (Wobe), and team productivity
        (Baloonr).
      </p>
      <p>
        Responsibilities primarily included either redesigns of existing
        products with emphasis on prototyping, or augmenting the in-house team
        with a designer/developer skillset.
      </p>
    </article>
    <article>
      <h3>UX Designer at Arkin</h3>
      <p>Acquired by VMWare; now vRealize Network Insight</p>
      <p>
        <time datetime="2014">2014</time> - <time datetime="2016">2016</time>
      </p>
      <p>
        One of two designers tasked with building out a product from scratch to
        complement an engineering team that grew from 8 to ~50 members before
        acquisition.
      </p>
      <p>
        Primary focus on simplifying the user experience to aid in monitoring
        and discovery of various components that make up a datacenter.
        Highlights include a natural language search interface and
        highly-scalable visualizations (to accomodate devices in thousands).
      </p>
      <p>
        Co-creator on patent <a
          href="https://patents.google.com/patent/US9923782B1">US9923782B1</a
        >
      </p>
    </article>
    <article>
      <h3>Software Engineer at Aricent Networks (CapGemini)</h3>
      <p>
        <time datetime="2010">2010</time> - <time datetime="2012">2012</time>
      </p>
      <p>
        Wrote some C++ code inside a proprietary visual editor to define routing
        logic for Alcatel Lucent clients in Europe.
      </p>
    </article>
    <article>
      <h3>Software Engineer at CPA Global</h3>
      <p>
        <time datetime="2009">2009</time> - <time datetime="2010">2010</time>
      </p>
      <p>
        Wrote database migration scripts to onboard new clients on a patent
        portfolio management system sold by CPA Global.
      </p>
    </article>
  </article>
  <article>
    <h2>Education</h2>
    <article>
      <h3>
        Master of Human-Computer Interaction from Carnegie Mellon University
      </h3>
      <p>
        <time datetime="2012">2012</time> - <time datetime="2013">2013</time>
      </p>
    </article>
    <article>
      <h3>Bachelors of Technology in Computer Science from Amity University</h3>
      <p>
        <time datetime="2005">2005</time> - <time datetime="2009">2009</time>
